            "review_title": "Review at Thanh Nien",
            "review_text": "Jean-Marie White\nSan Jose, California5 contributions\n0\nFresh bursting Vietnamese flavors\nNov 2025 • Couples\nThe restaurant is lovely, just behind the Diamond mall. The menu had pictures so it was easier to grok all the options. The servers were courteous and friendly. Another reviewer complained about not getting attended. I also thought it was taking a while but as soon as I waived to our waitress she came right over. The food was excellent, fresh, full of flavors. The drink options were fantastic (tried the ones with salted plums).\nRead more\nWritten November 22, 2025",
