            "review_text": "CanisHan\nSeoul, South Korea31379 contributions\n5\nThe atmosphere is good, the food is delicious, and the friendly restaurant\nMar 2024 • Solo\nC ( 24.03.10 )\nI visited this restaurant for lunch during my trip to Ho Chi Minh City. I liked the atmosphere, and the staff were very friendly. I ordered a dish and beer by myself, which was very satisfying and I was full. It was reasonably priced, and it was good to eat while taking my time. Personally, it is a satisfactory restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 13, 2024",
