            "review_text": "Banhbaokp\n1 contribution\n0\nBad bad bad bad badddddd !!\nDec 2019 • Family\nI came here with my family !\n\nFirst of all, I ordered broken rice with grilled pork chop, shredded pork skin and pork pie. The grilled pork chop wassssss verrrrryyyy dry !!! Not juicy at alllll !!! The pork pie was also not met the vietnamese food’s standard !! \n\nSecondly, those employees there!! They were gathering in the air-conditioner room! Talking and talking !! Did not bother to refill the ice-tea !! \nMoreover, this place did not refill ice-tea ! Instead this place brought me another glass of tea ! Charged for 2 glasses !\n\nBeing here the first time will be the lasstttt time hereeeeeee!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 10, 2019",
