            "review_title": "Review at Thanh Nien",
            "review_text": "Phillip N\n1 contribution\n0\nExcellent buffet restaurant for the weekend\nJul 2018 • Friends\nReturned to VN for a visit as a tourist after 6 years working in HCMC, couldn't resist to check out Thanh Nien for the buffet on the weekend. Fantastic food . Everything is so fresh now under the managed care of a wonderful lady (MT) and her husband (Eosi). I love the nem nuong which is freshly grilled on real charcoal not like Brodard in US. Nem Nuong at Brodard in US is nothing compared to VN. If you come to HCMC, must must check out the buffet on the weekend. And one more thing, price is so reasonable.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 18, 2018",
