            "review_text": "ntguy\nBrossard, Canada720 contributions\n0\nA good and charming buffet restaurant serving delicious vietnamese classics\nMay 2018 • Couples\nThis place is a vietnamse style buffett restaurant serving fresh and tasty viet food. Very nice venue with many trees and shrubs in a backyard ambience. Many classic dishes are cooked and served continously. There is a grill station where you select your preferred meat or sea food. Refresments drinks and sweet desserts are included. Alcoholic beverages are extra. All you can eat including one beer costs about 400 K vnd.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 5, 2018",
