            "review_text": "Max D\nLakewood, California17 contributions\n0\nA Vietnamese restaurant riff a Vietnamese ' family off\nJan 2018 • Family\nI order a pot of hot water for my own foreigner instant coffee cost 40,000VND ( I don't drink Vietnam corns, beans, and black color, coffee flavor add). equal price list 25,000VND for hot Lipton teapot.\n6OZ of fresh milk for my coffee cost 70,000VND. equal to fresh 22oz orange juice glass. or double for 22oz ice condensed milk coffee.\nEndup: No tip for service-we won't come back forever-we won't recommence to anyone.\nTook a middle age waiter 3-trip: First hot water and a cup, second 2 packs sugar for coffee, thirst a small spoon or I use my finger to steer my coffee :( \nPoor ethical practice in business. \nThinking twice before you step in this facility.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 21, 2018",
