            "review_text": "Turtlegohome\nHonolulu, Hawaii11 contributions\n0\nPleasant place for a variety of buffet choices.\nJul 2017 • Solo\nFor dinner around $10 USD per person, I enjoyed beautifully displayed authentic Vietnamese dishes were displayed in six different stations, each with 5-7 choices of sauce. Real time pho varieties, grills and Vietnamese pancake can be made to order. Seating options include open air garden, veranda, an A/C family room, and a more intimate Lotus themed room. Enough staffing is made to ensure properly attended customer service.\nRead more\nWritten July 14, 2017",
